:: Pharmacy
<<unset $pharmacyItem>>
<<if $daily.pharm.closed>>
	A "Closed" sign hangs on the door. You tug the door but it's locked.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Go back|Hospital Foyer]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
	<<endevent>>
	You are inside the hospital pharmacy.

	<<if "pharmNurse" in $per_npc>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "pharmNurse">><<person1>>
		<<if $daily.pharm.seductionResult is "fail">>
			<br>
			The <<person>> looks up from <<his>> book. "Hey, you're back." <<He>> returns to reading.
		<<elseif $daily.pharm.seductionResult is "pass">>
			<<if $daily.pharm.sexResult is "buy">>
				The <<person>> at the till looks up at you, then returns to <<his>> book with a faint blush.
			<<elseif $daily.pharm.sexResult is "embarrassed">>
				The <<person>> at the till looks up at you with a smirk, then returns to <<his>> book.
			<<else>>
				The <<person>> at the till looks up at you, then returns to <<his>> book.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			The <<person>> at the till looks up at you, then returns to <<his>> book.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<generateRole 0 0 "nurse">><<person1>>
		<<saveNPC 0 "pharmNurse">>
		A $description <<male>> nurse sits by the till and reads a book.
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $brothelVending and $brothelVending.status is "set" and $settings.condomLevel gte 1 and !($brothelVending.products % 2)>>
		<br>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about buying condoms in bulk (0:15)|Pharmacy Buy Condoms in Bulk]]>><<unset $phase2>><<pass 15>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	Looking at the items on the shelves, you notice a few objects of interest.
	<br><br>

	<<if $pharmacyXChangeView is undefined>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "menu">><</if>>
	X-Change:
	<br>
	<<if $pharmacyXChangeView is "menu">>
		<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[Browse Gray X-Change|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[Browse Pink X-Change|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "pink">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[Browse Blue X-Change|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[Browse Purple X-Change|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "pillcure">><<link [[Browse Antidotes & Tests|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $pharmacyXChangeView is "pink">>
		See other variants: <<link [[Gray|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>> | <<link [[Blue|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>> | <<link [[Purple|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>> | <<link [[Antidotes & Tests|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[Pack of 3 X-Change Basics|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_basic"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-Change NOW|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_now"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-Change Weekly|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_weekly"]>><</link>>
		<br>
